prompt:
A real photograph of a young woman's bedroom in an old Berlin building on a bright morning, taken as a friend standing in the doorway would take it with a good phone camera, in a tall vertical picture, everything in sharp focus. Natural colours, bright morning daylight from a large window on the right. The textures of real wood, linen, cotton, wool, leather, paper, glass and skin.

The first reference picture shows the young woman in three-quarter view, the second from the front: her face, her dark blonde hair tied back in a ponytail, her build and her height stay exactly as in them. Use them for the person only; her clothes here are a light-blue T-shirt, white trousers and white socks, her feet bare of shoes.

Every object in the room stands on its own, with a little space around it, so that the eye can tell at once where each thing is. Nothing in the picture carries any writing, numbers or print: the passport cover is plain dark red, the map shows only coloured land and sea, the books and the clock have plain faces and plain covers.

THE BED fills the lower half of the picture: a large wooden double bed seen from slightly above, with a white duvet, two white pillows against the headboard and a folded green woollen blanket at its foot. On the bed, from the left of the picture to the right:
- a large open blue suitcase, already half full, with folded clothes inside it: a white blouse, a pair of jeans and a striped T-shirt;
- next to the suitcase, a neat pile of clothes still to pack: a red dress folded on top, a yellow swimsuit and two pairs of rolled socks;
- a straw sun hat lying on the duvet;
- a camera with a black strap;
- a dark-red passport and a brown leather wallet lying side by side;
- an unfolded paper map showing only the coastline of a sunny country in green and blue, with no names;
- a phone charger with its white cable rolled up.

THE YOUNG WOMAN of the reference pictures stands at the right side of the bed, seen whole from her head to her feet, which stand on a round blue rug on the wooden floor with their shadow under them. She is caught in the middle of packing: she holds a folded light-green sweater against her chest with both hands and looks down at the open suitcase, thinking, with a half-smile that reaches her eyes.

THE ROOM around the bed, from the left of the picture to the right:
- on the left, a small wooden bedside table with a round white alarm clock with a plain face and a small reading lamp with a white shade;
- above the bed, a large framed poster of a sunny beach with blue sea and palm trees, with no writing on it;
- in the back left corner, a tall white wardrobe with one door open, showing a few clothes on hangers and a pair of white sneakers on its floor;
- in the back right, a wooden desk under the window with a closed laptop and a pot plant on it, and a wooden chair in front of it with a denim jacket hanging over its back;
- the large window on the right, with long light-grey curtains drawn open on either side and the green trees of the courtyard outside;
- a brown leather backpack leaning against the foot of the bed on the floor.

The walls are painted white, the floor is old light wooden boards.
